WEBVTT

01:30.680 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:58.240 --> 01:59.160
I'll take care of him.

02:00.800 --> 02:02.120
I'll do it. Stay out of the way.

02:06.920 --> 02:08.680
Go back. You are no part of this.

02:11.200 --> 02:12.600
I will deal with him.

02:15.040 --> 02:16.440
I said I will.

02:16.520 --> 02:17.960
Are you going to keep this up forever?

02:35.160 --> 02:36.680
What's going on?

02:37.320 --> 02:39.400
You… What did you do?

02:41.680 --> 02:44.400
Miss Gao is injured
and has trouble moving.

02:44.480 --> 02:45.480
Let's talk here.

02:45.560 --> 02:47.760
I will prepare the room for Miss Gao.

02:52.920 --> 02:54.000
You stayed behind

02:54.600 --> 02:57.600
to keep me busy
and get more time for the array to form.

02:59.160 --> 03:00.360
How did I get exposed?

03:08.560 --> 03:09.920
The moment you started talking.

03:10.520 --> 03:11.680
How is that possible?

03:13.160 --> 03:15.360
-What did I do wrong?
-Well,

03:18.160 --> 03:19.080
why would I tell you?

03:23.400 --> 03:24.280
Beats me.

03:26.680 --> 03:27.560
Shall we give you the answer,

03:27.640 --> 03:29.880
so that you know how to improve next time?

03:30.760 --> 03:32.200
Silly.

03:34.880 --> 03:38.120
-Even you are calling me that now.
-Xuyue.

03:46.080 --> 03:47.000
Suppress.

03:51.480 --> 03:54.200
With the rune as the base
and the spirit ink painting,

03:55.160 --> 03:57.240
this fan holds another realm.

03:57.760 --> 03:59.200
The show in the realm must be good.

04:01.240 --> 04:02.360
It's a pity

04:03.360 --> 04:05.040
that I don't get to see it.

04:23.920 --> 04:26.520
-How long can the fan constrain him?
-What's this?

04:26.600 --> 04:28.840
-Not long.
-What did I do wrong?

04:29.360 --> 04:31.640
-So, he's going to get out.
-What is this place?

04:31.720 --> 04:33.160
-That's because
-What did I do wrong?

04:33.240 --> 04:35.160
-he will merge with the painting
-Why?

04:35.240 --> 04:36.360
and become a part of it.

04:37.320 --> 04:38.640
That means

04:39.400 --> 04:41.200
he will be without life.

04:42.160 --> 04:43.280
You are good.

04:44.320 --> 04:46.080
The tacit between you two

04:46.600 --> 04:48.400
makes me jealous a little bit.

04:49.080 --> 04:51.080
I'm also curious.

04:51.160 --> 04:52.720
What did Anger Demon say that exposed him?

04:53.760 --> 04:54.920
Enlighten us.

05:00.480 --> 05:01.320
You…

05:03.720 --> 05:05.200
You… He…

05:05.960 --> 05:07.560
He doesn't want to say it just yet.

05:07.640 --> 05:10.200
He will tell you when he does.

05:10.280 --> 05:11.480
He carried her!

05:14.520 --> 05:15.760
Do you believe that he carried her?

05:21.240 --> 05:22.280
Yes.

05:25.200 --> 05:27.000
Why did I bother to help him?

05:29.160 --> 05:30.520
Mr. Nan,

05:33.240 --> 05:35.440
is it too late to release Anger Demon?

05:37.920 --> 05:40.760
Maybe you should cool yourself.

05:41.800 --> 05:42.640
Calm down.

05:46.160 --> 05:47.120
Is the marriage arrangement

05:48.200 --> 05:49.240
between those two real?

05:51.800 --> 05:52.840
Based on my knowledge,

05:52.920 --> 05:55.040
it's just a rumor
in the Immortal Alliance.

06:00.400 --> 06:02.760
Miss Gao was born in Moonlight Heights.

06:03.440 --> 06:04.960
As the daughter
of the former Immortal Alliance leader,

06:05.040 --> 06:06.320
Gao Fengxu,

06:06.840 --> 06:08.480
she has great natural talent.

06:09.200 --> 06:11.720
Years ago, someone proposed

06:11.800 --> 06:15.360
that there should be a marriage
between Moonlight Heights and Snow City.

06:16.000 --> 06:17.720
It was just a joke.

06:18.280 --> 06:21.840
The more people talk about it,
the more genuine it gets.

06:23.760 --> 06:24.960
Ten years ago,

06:25.040 --> 06:27.440
Sang Qi's troops
attacked Moonlight Heights.

06:27.520 --> 06:28.760
Xuechen happened to be there

06:29.280 --> 06:30.960
and saved Miss Gao.

06:31.480 --> 06:32.840
A lot of people think

06:33.560 --> 06:35.440
that they will end up together.

06:38.800 --> 06:41.680
Ten years have passed,
and that still hasn't happened yet.

06:44.560 --> 06:45.960
That battle

06:46.040 --> 06:48.360
was a massacre on Moonlight Heights.

06:48.880 --> 06:50.640
Miss Gao was the only survivor.

06:51.600 --> 06:55.400
Su Ningzhen, Madam of the Mirage Palace
and aunt to Miss Gao,

06:55.480 --> 06:57.440
accepted her as a disciple

06:57.520 --> 06:58.840
and taught her everything she knew.

06:59.760 --> 07:00.960
She's also a rigorous teacher.

07:01.040 --> 07:02.840
So,

07:02.920 --> 07:06.720
she has been so busy with cultivation
that she didn't have time for romance.

07:08.840 --> 07:10.080
That, I don't know.

07:11.520 --> 07:14.480
It's just that based on my observation,

07:15.000 --> 07:18.400
I don't think
they are as close as the rumor.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.120
So,

07:24.640 --> 07:26.720
Anger Demon was wrong
to show caring to Xie Xuechen

07:28.280 --> 07:29.480
at the beginning.

07:32.160 --> 07:35.560
I, for one, have never heard
Miss Gao adress Xuechen

07:36.080 --> 07:37.160
as Young Lord.

07:39.840 --> 07:40.920
But

07:41.440 --> 07:42.840
I don't think

07:43.640 --> 07:45.880
Xie Xuechen entered
the spiritual form level ten years ago.

07:46.920 --> 07:50.080
How did he survive
the massacre of Sang Qi's troops

07:50.600 --> 07:51.640
while saving someone?

07:53.200 --> 07:54.320
Miss Mu, are you curious about it?

07:54.920 --> 07:56.440
It's a legendary story.

07:56.520 --> 07:58.840
People always want to hear it.

08:01.040 --> 08:02.240
I don't know.

08:02.920 --> 08:03.920
Sometimes,

08:04.440 --> 08:07.840
if the hero doesn't say anything,
no one knows the truth.

08:07.920 --> 08:09.520
All I know

08:09.600 --> 08:11.960
is that he went into seclusion
on the Snow Cliff afterward.

08:12.600 --> 08:13.800
Seven years later,

08:14.320 --> 08:15.640
he made an unprecedentedly
shocking sword swing

08:15.720 --> 08:17.360
on the peak of the Snow Cliff

08:17.880 --> 08:19.160
and entered the spiritual form level.

08:19.240 --> 08:20.720
That's when his seclusion ended.

08:23.280 --> 08:24.440
You don't know that either.

08:35.000 --> 08:36.840
Mr. Nan, did you find this?

08:42.520 --> 08:43.760
It's Xie Xuechen.

08:44.400 --> 08:45.680
He went back for me.

08:47.800 --> 08:52.480
Forgive me if I'm being presumptuous,
but I have a question.

08:54.160 --> 08:55.440
Ask away.

08:57.680 --> 09:00.440
What's your angle
for trying to get close to Xuechen?

09:00.520 --> 09:02.160
Because I like him. What else could it be?

09:05.360 --> 09:06.600
You don't mind Miss Gao anymore.

09:09.000 --> 09:11.880
Xie Xuechen doesn't like her anyway.

09:14.600 --> 09:17.200
It sounds like you are sure
that Xuechen will fall for you.

09:21.080 --> 09:24.880
If it's hard for him,
he doesn't have to fall for me.

09:25.480 --> 09:26.960
He can keep guarding the world

09:28.080 --> 09:29.480
while I stay by his side.

09:38.080 --> 09:40.520
There's something else I need to do.
Please excuse me.

09:50.160 --> 09:51.360
Is that…

09:52.560 --> 09:55.040
giving without asking for equal return?

10:12.080 --> 10:12.920
You are dead.

10:13.880 --> 10:16.240
Maybe not yet.

10:17.720 --> 10:18.960
You are not dead.

10:19.040 --> 10:22.280
Then Xie Xuechen is dead.
Or is it Mu Xuanling?

10:24.240 --> 10:27.680
I think they are also both alive.

10:29.040 --> 10:30.760
So, what did you do exactly?

10:31.280 --> 10:33.520
Was it just a sunbathing trip for you?

10:35.320 --> 10:37.920
It's good that you are alive.
Ask your projection to come back.

10:52.160 --> 10:53.160
I can't do that?

10:53.240 --> 10:55.120
What is that supposed to mean?

10:55.200 --> 10:57.120
I don't know what happened.

10:57.200 --> 10:58.440
I just sense

10:58.520 --> 11:03.280
that he's in an empty and quiet place,

11:03.880 --> 11:05.200
repeating one sentence.

11:05.880 --> 11:06.960
What's the sentence?

11:09.240 --> 11:10.240
What did I say?

11:11.360 --> 11:12.400
What did you say?

11:13.640 --> 11:16.080
Not me. Him. He's saying,

11:16.160 --> 11:17.280
"What did I say?"

11:17.920 --> 11:19.520
So, what did he say?

11:20.520 --> 11:21.560
I don't know.

11:23.000 --> 11:24.720
Who made this stupid elixir?

11:27.080 --> 11:29.000
I don't think
the elixir is to blame this time.

11:29.520 --> 11:31.200
I just don't know.

11:32.920 --> 11:35.120
After losing two projections in two days,

11:35.200 --> 11:36.640
not only we didn't achieve anything,

11:37.520 --> 11:39.080
but we also don't know anything.

11:39.640 --> 11:42.360
If His Grace hears about this,
we will follow the projections' steps.

11:43.120 --> 11:45.640
Then why are you wasting our time?
Where is your projection?

11:46.240 --> 11:49.520
What did I say?

11:54.640 --> 11:55.680
I'll be ready soon.

11:59.640 --> 12:02.440
What did I say?

12:09.080 --> 12:10.320
I gave you Klicks

12:11.160 --> 12:14.400
along with the fate of the world.

12:15.000 --> 12:19.680
Yet you used it to kill your allies
and committed this serious crime.

12:21.040 --> 12:23.760
You are not worthy of this sword.

12:24.880 --> 12:25.880
But…

12:27.200 --> 12:28.760
But I don't remember anything.

12:28.840 --> 12:30.960
That doesn't mean it didn't happen.

12:32.520 --> 12:35.360
I've told you countless times
that you can't be sentimental.

12:36.000 --> 12:38.760
You thought that I was forcing you
and defied me constantly.

12:39.360 --> 12:41.960
Now that the truth
is right under your nose.

12:42.880 --> 12:46.640
If you could have been detached
and put your desires aside,

12:46.720 --> 12:50.080
how could the Dark Clan member have
the chance to use you and possess you?

12:51.240 --> 12:52.480
Now,

12:53.080 --> 12:55.440
your hands and sword

12:55.960 --> 12:57.920
are covered in the blood of our allies.

12:58.640 --> 12:59.920
How are you supposed

13:00.880 --> 13:03.640
to focus on your faith?

13:05.560 --> 13:06.560
With more power,

13:07.560 --> 13:09.160
you face a greater risk
of creating severe disaster

13:09.240 --> 13:10.600
once you take the wrong turn.

13:11.240 --> 13:12.960
No one knows about this right now.

13:13.480 --> 13:14.400
You just stay here
and reflect on what you did.

13:14.480 --> 13:16.560
Collect your thoughts. Be responsible.

13:18.240 --> 13:19.720
I hope

13:19.800 --> 13:23.480
I won't regret my decision today.

13:27.920 --> 13:29.200
I'm not leaving the mountain

13:30.680 --> 13:32.080
until my faith is solid.

13:55.240 --> 13:56.680
Xie Xuechen!

14:03.320 --> 14:04.600
You are up.

14:05.440 --> 14:07.960
What is this place? How did I get here?

14:08.040 --> 14:09.000
You were possessed by the Dark Clan

14:09.680 --> 14:11.000
and came to Greenview Heights.

14:11.080 --> 14:11.960
Possessed?

14:13.640 --> 14:15.720
All I can remember
is that I was attacked on my way

14:15.800 --> 14:16.960
back to Mirage Palace.

14:17.640 --> 14:19.360
The next thing I remember
is waking up here.

14:20.640 --> 14:21.680
What did I do?

14:21.760 --> 14:22.880
Nothing.

14:23.480 --> 14:24.400
It's solved.

14:27.760 --> 14:31.160
The hateful Dark Clan members,
always sneaking up on people.

14:31.240 --> 14:33.400
I will kill every one of them
that dares to show their faces.

14:41.600 --> 14:44.480
So, that's how it feels like
to be possessed by the Dark Clan.

14:45.800 --> 14:48.680
I don't remember what I've done at all.

14:49.200 --> 14:51.160
I have to hear about it from someone else.

14:55.120 --> 14:57.720
Did I do something
that has consequences, right?

14:57.800 --> 14:58.960
No.

15:02.720 --> 15:04.880
Oh, right! My companion, Cui Wanwan…

15:04.960 --> 15:07.680
Don't worry. Mr. Nan
has sent someone to find her.

15:09.720 --> 15:12.440
-Thank you.
-You should rest.

15:15.760 --> 15:16.960
Xie Xuechen!

15:19.600 --> 15:21.440
Madam Su sent me to find you.

15:22.200 --> 15:23.760
I couldn't have said no.

15:24.400 --> 15:26.680
Since you are all right,
my task is finished.

15:26.760 --> 15:28.040
I know.

15:28.880 --> 15:29.720
Thank you.

15:43.960 --> 15:44.960
That's sour!

16:13.400 --> 16:15.800
It's a beautiful night.
Why do you look so sad?

16:15.880 --> 16:18.560
I just got some fruit. Try them.

16:25.800 --> 16:27.560
Why are you here instead of healing?

16:28.920 --> 16:30.800
Are you worried about me?

16:31.400 --> 16:32.320
That's not what this is.

16:32.400 --> 16:34.440
I just don't like owing someone.

16:37.840 --> 16:41.320
That brutal Anger Demon
hits harder than Desire Demon.

16:45.120 --> 16:48.120
Judging from your status,
your spiritual power is coming back.

16:48.880 --> 16:49.720
What are you planning now?

16:49.800 --> 16:51.320
What could I do?

16:52.280 --> 16:55.040
I just want to ask a question.

17:00.080 --> 17:01.280
Can I

17:02.080 --> 17:03.960
go to Snow City with you?

17:04.720 --> 17:06.520
Don't reject me just yet.

17:07.040 --> 17:09.480
There's still time. You can sleep on it.

17:10.079 --> 17:13.160
Keep in mind how I helped you today.

17:20.960 --> 17:22.920
Why didn't you tell me

17:24.400 --> 17:26.040
that you went back for me?

17:34.920 --> 17:36.640
Why did you go back?

17:41.320 --> 17:42.480
Whatever it is,

17:43.000 --> 17:44.760
you did go back.

17:44.840 --> 17:45.800
That's all I need.

17:45.880 --> 17:47.240
Xie Xuechen.

17:47.760 --> 17:49.960
I hereby announce that all between us
is forgiven and forgotten.

17:52.040 --> 17:54.320
I'm tired. I'll go have a rest.

17:54.840 --> 17:56.280
You should stop watching the moon.

17:56.360 --> 17:58.160
The more time you spend here,
the worse you feel.

18:03.200 --> 18:06.560
Have a fruit and get a good sleep.

18:07.520 --> 18:08.800
Nice dream.

18:27.800 --> 18:29.160
Friends share burdens.

18:42.920 --> 18:44.280
Xuanling!

18:45.880 --> 18:47.360
I miss you so much!

18:47.920 --> 18:51.160
And that horrible thing
doesn't seem so scary now.

18:51.240 --> 18:53.040
That's because he was locked up.

18:53.680 --> 18:56.920
Xuanling. How come you look

18:57.000 --> 19:00.560
so much more happier after your errand?

19:00.640 --> 19:01.640
Do I?

19:15.480 --> 19:17.680
-What happened?
-It's Feng Yao's signal.

19:18.280 --> 19:20.920
It's from Mirage City!

19:21.960 --> 19:23.160
Did something happen to the Mirage Palace?

19:23.960 --> 19:26.440
Firework colors carry different meanings.

19:26.520 --> 19:27.840
The magenta color

19:28.840 --> 19:29.960
means enemy attack.

19:30.840 --> 19:31.760
Is it the Dark Clan?

19:32.560 --> 19:33.880
That's one possibility.

19:34.560 --> 19:35.640
But it's not the only one.

19:37.000 --> 19:39.440
-The traitor in Immortal Alliance.
-Traitor?

19:39.520 --> 19:42.200
Instead of guessing, we might as well
check things out ourselves.

19:43.480 --> 19:46.680
Pardon me. Young girl, you are…

19:58.080 --> 19:58.920
She's my cousin.

19:59.520 --> 20:02.040
Ling. A distant relative.

20:04.120 --> 20:05.880
Yes, Cousin.

20:07.480 --> 20:08.680
Nice to meet you.

20:09.280 --> 20:10.560
There's no time to waste.

20:10.640 --> 20:12.720
Let's set off to Mirage City
in a stick of incense.

20:14.600 --> 20:16.400
-I'm coming with you.
-You…

20:16.480 --> 20:18.840
How can I not go when my cousin is going?

20:18.920 --> 20:20.600
I can't feel at ease.

20:26.800 --> 20:28.240
You can wait here.

20:30.600 --> 20:32.160
If you don't want to take me along, fine.

20:32.760 --> 20:35.720
I will get there by myself.

20:37.680 --> 20:38.800
Travel together, then.

20:38.880 --> 20:40.240
Let's go get ready

20:41.240 --> 20:42.160
and meet up in a stick of incense.

20:55.240 --> 20:56.480
Later.

21:04.320 --> 21:05.520
Xie Xuechen.

21:11.400 --> 21:13.040
I should remind you.

21:13.640 --> 21:15.400
Gao Qiumin saw us in the staging post.

21:16.000 --> 21:17.840
Your Jun Tian Sword was exposed.

21:17.920 --> 21:19.280
You'd better hide it.

21:19.360 --> 21:22.200
If she recognizes your sword,
I'll have to fight with her again.

21:23.080 --> 21:24.120
I don't mind that,

21:24.760 --> 21:25.880
but it will end badly for her.

21:28.280 --> 21:30.360
Hiding the sword is easy
now that I have my spiritual power.

21:31.040 --> 21:31.920
You are the problem.

21:32.000 --> 21:34.120
You have to follow me,
and I can't do anything about that.

21:34.640 --> 21:35.960
But I'm digging my heel in the ground.

21:36.760 --> 21:38.920
-Behave!
-I will.

21:39.000 --> 21:41.080
Su Ningzhen, Madam of the Mirage Palace,

21:41.160 --> 21:43.680
is the one who hates the Spirit Clan
the most in the whole Immortal Alliance.

21:43.760 --> 21:46.240
If you don't want to die,
hide your identity.

21:46.760 --> 21:47.840
And if you cause trouble again,

21:48.600 --> 21:51.160
I'm not helping you.
Even if it's a life-and-death situation.

21:57.320 --> 22:00.760
MIRAGE PALACE

22:00.840 --> 22:03.480
MIRAGE PALACE

22:05.920 --> 22:07.600
HALL OF LIVELY SPRING

22:21.800 --> 22:22.720
Madam.

22:23.320 --> 22:24.520
What's the situation?

22:25.040 --> 22:27.440
We can't find the person.
Searching is still ongoing.

22:27.520 --> 22:29.280
The security of the palace is tight.

22:29.360 --> 22:31.400
How did the member
of the Spirit Clan member get in,

22:31.480 --> 22:32.640
steal the Sect Leader's Token,

22:32.720 --> 22:34.240
and get out?

22:36.080 --> 22:40.360
SU NINGZHEN, MADAM OF MIRAGE PALACE

22:41.680 --> 22:43.120
I knew this would happen.

22:43.640 --> 22:46.320
Never let your enemies get too close.

22:46.840 --> 22:48.960
We should have eliminated the Spirit Clan.

22:49.040 --> 22:50.280
The city is in lockdown.

22:50.360 --> 22:51.200
ZAI XI, ELDER OF MIRAGE PALACE

22:51.280 --> 22:53.840
The Spirit Clan member was injured.
There's no escaping.

22:54.560 --> 22:56.200
Madam, no need to be anxious.

22:56.280 --> 22:59.000
Getting the Sect Leader's Token back
is just a matter of time.

23:02.160 --> 23:03.320
Madam.

23:06.200 --> 23:07.320
Elder Zai Xi.

23:08.200 --> 23:09.280
I'm back.

23:09.360 --> 23:10.400
Qiumin,

23:11.040 --> 23:13.480
a cultivator from the Greenview Heights
sent Wanwan back

23:13.560 --> 23:15.040
and mentioned that you
were attacked and injured.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.520
Madam, don't worry about me.

23:17.600 --> 23:18.440
I'm fine.

23:18.520 --> 23:21.760
It's just that I got the fireworks message
that says there has been an enemy attack.

23:21.840 --> 23:22.920
We got back right away.

23:23.520 --> 23:24.400
We?

23:24.920 --> 23:27.520
Xie Xuechen, Nan Xuyue, and me.

23:28.040 --> 23:30.000
Oh, and Nan Xuyue's cousin.

23:30.080 --> 23:31.200
We got back to Mirage City together.

23:31.800 --> 23:32.720
Where are they right now?

23:32.800 --> 23:34.120
As we were getting into the city,

23:34.200 --> 23:36.000
the security was so strict

23:36.080 --> 23:37.800
that we could only get in,
but we couldn't get out.

23:38.440 --> 23:40.640
I asked about the reason and learned

23:40.720 --> 23:41.840
that the Sect Leader's Token was stolen.

23:42.480 --> 23:44.960
They said that
the thief is still at large.

23:45.040 --> 23:46.880
So, we made another plan.

23:48.520 --> 23:49.440
Out of the way! Out of the way!

23:49.520 --> 23:50.360
Move aside!

23:50.440 --> 23:51.520
Let's go check things out over there.

23:51.600 --> 23:52.800
-Yes.
-Clear the path!

23:52.880 --> 23:53.720
-Move aside!
-Move!

23:53.800 --> 23:54.800
-This way!
-Move aside!

23:54.880 --> 23:55.720
-Don't push us.
-Get off.

23:55.800 --> 23:57.520
-Hey, come here.
-Is that…

23:59.120 --> 24:01.040
Thank you for your spirit ink rune.

24:01.120 --> 24:03.240
It got me through the search
of the Spirit Management Bureau.

24:04.160 --> 24:06.080
Why didn't Bao
insist on coming with you this time?

24:07.120 --> 24:08.400
She did.

24:08.920 --> 24:10.160
I told her

24:10.240 --> 24:12.400
that Gao Qiumin and the Spirit
Management Bureau would be there.

24:12.480 --> 24:14.040
She quit that thought right away.

24:14.640 --> 24:16.520
She said that she'd wait for us
at the Greenview Heights

24:17.040 --> 24:18.200
and wished me a nice trip.

24:22.160 --> 24:24.120
How much spiritual power
have you restored?

24:27.400 --> 24:28.240
Less than 20%.

24:30.000 --> 24:31.480
Less than 20%?

24:32.000 --> 24:34.200
Why did you suggest that we make our moves

24:34.280 --> 24:35.120
without any help from Mirage Palace?

24:35.800 --> 24:38.040
Mirage Palace is making big moves.

24:38.560 --> 24:39.800
It's hard for them to find anything.

24:40.400 --> 24:42.240
We'll investigate in secret.

24:43.040 --> 24:44.760
We might get some results.

24:45.880 --> 24:46.840
Besides,

24:47.360 --> 24:51.120
it doesn't take too much strength
to find someone who's lurking.

24:51.200 --> 24:53.320
Five tokens can open the Pearl Tower.

24:54.240 --> 24:56.200
Losing the token of the Mirage Palace

24:58.400 --> 25:00.040
is just the beginning.

25:05.480 --> 25:06.640
In that case,

25:06.720 --> 25:08.280
give them some space.

25:09.840 --> 25:10.920
But

25:11.560 --> 25:13.240
if they are making any moves,

25:13.840 --> 25:15.320
you need to let me know right away.

25:16.240 --> 25:18.480
-Do you understand?
-Yes, Madam.

25:19.400 --> 25:22.200
Oh, right! The reason
why Xie Xuechen went missing

25:22.280 --> 25:25.040
is that he was ambushed by Sang Qi
and taken to the Lava.

25:25.120 --> 25:27.440
Sang Qi's target is the Chaos Pearl.

25:27.960 --> 25:28.880
Sang Qi!

25:35.160 --> 25:37.760
I should have finished him off
once and for all.

25:38.840 --> 25:40.560
That despicable Spirit Clan member

25:40.640 --> 25:43.000
brought massacre
to the Moonlight Heights for the pearl,

25:43.080 --> 25:45.160
leaving you all alone.

25:45.880 --> 25:47.960
Now he's trying to get back on his feet.

25:50.000 --> 25:51.800
Qiumin, you should hate him.

25:51.880 --> 25:53.480
One day, you will kill him.

25:53.560 --> 25:57.160
-Kill him! You have to!
-Madam! My hand…

25:57.240 --> 25:58.160
Madam.

26:00.440 --> 26:02.880
I lost my head. That was my fault.

26:04.200 --> 26:06.720
-Take Qiumin for treatment.
-Let's go.

26:18.040 --> 26:19.440
She's all grown up.

26:20.080 --> 26:22.200
She looks more and more like my sister.

26:24.680 --> 26:27.040
Yet she's no match for my sister.

26:28.200 --> 26:31.000
My sister has never been
such an embarrassment

26:31.880 --> 26:34.160
and allowed someone to hurt her so badly.

26:39.880 --> 26:41.600
REJUVENATION PAVILION

26:41.680 --> 26:43.120
The wound is not deep.

26:43.200 --> 26:44.880
It will take just one day or two to heal.

26:47.440 --> 26:48.560
Thank you, Elder Zai Xi.

26:48.640 --> 26:51.760
It has been a long trip for you. Rest.

27:02.000 --> 27:02.960
That hurts!

27:17.400 --> 27:18.240
Come in.

27:29.480 --> 27:31.280
Senior, it's me.

27:31.360 --> 27:32.480
Stop pretending.

27:33.200 --> 27:35.240
I was scared. I might…

27:37.920 --> 27:40.440
Wanwan, what happened to your hand?

27:40.960 --> 27:42.920
Nothing. It's just a bony crack.

27:43.000 --> 27:44.000
I have gotten treatment

27:44.080 --> 27:45.480
and will recover in a month.

27:46.080 --> 27:47.520
Don't worry, Senior.

27:48.320 --> 27:50.720
Okay, sit. I'll get you some tea.

27:50.800 --> 27:51.680
Sit.

27:55.120 --> 27:56.400
Have some tea.

27:56.480 --> 27:57.320
Thank you.

28:00.760 --> 28:01.600
This time,

28:01.680 --> 28:04.440
I was saved and escorted back by Feng Yao
from the Greenview Heights.

28:04.520 --> 28:05.960
I was up the whole night,

28:06.040 --> 28:08.040
worrying something
might have happened to you.

28:08.560 --> 28:11.440
But seeing you all safe and sound,
I feel relieved.

28:12.040 --> 28:13.800
Senior, what happened?

28:14.560 --> 28:15.840
How were things?

28:17.080 --> 28:19.600
The member of the Dark Clan possessed me.

28:19.680 --> 28:21.800
-If I catch him, I--
-Possessed by the Dark Clan?

28:22.640 --> 28:23.800
Keep it down.

28:25.120 --> 28:28.680
Do you want to let everyone know
about my shame?

28:30.960 --> 28:32.160
So…

28:32.240 --> 28:34.680
How did that happen?

28:36.440 --> 28:37.960
That doesn't matter.

28:38.040 --> 28:39.920
Anyway, I am embarrassed
in front of others.

28:40.000 --> 28:41.120
But I'll say this.

28:41.200 --> 28:44.960
If I see that demonic cultivator again,
I will get my revenge.

28:48.000 --> 28:50.200
I heard

28:52.040 --> 28:55.520
that it was Mr. Xie

28:56.320 --> 28:57.680
who sent you back.

28:58.920 --> 29:04.160
No. Nan Xuyue
and his cousin came along.

29:06.120 --> 29:06.960
Senior,

29:07.640 --> 29:09.120
why try so hard to explain?

29:09.200 --> 29:12.360
Mr. Xie is one of the best men,

29:12.440 --> 29:13.520
and you share a connection.

29:14.320 --> 29:18.400
Do you really feel nothing for him?

29:19.240 --> 29:20.360
The others believe the rumor,

29:20.440 --> 29:23.040
but shouldn't you know me better?
Cui Wanwan!

29:23.120 --> 29:24.320
All right.

29:28.360 --> 29:32.400
Well, Xie Xuechen
is a nice guy.

29:33.200 --> 29:35.280
He did save me when I was a child.

29:35.360 --> 29:37.080
I am grateful.

29:38.040 --> 29:41.160
It's just that people always say
something like

29:41.240 --> 29:44.080
I can't stop thinking about him
and adore him.

29:44.160 --> 29:45.000
That I will marry no one but him.

29:45.600 --> 29:47.200
The worst one is about

29:47.280 --> 29:49.760
the union of the beauty and the hero.

29:58.640 --> 29:59.600
But

30:01.880 --> 30:03.040
I am beautiful.

30:03.960 --> 30:06.400
-You are the most beautiful girl.
-Right?

30:07.080 --> 30:09.960
I was born with nine apertures.
Just one less aperture than him.

30:10.480 --> 30:13.320
I will make it
to the top of the human clan

30:13.400 --> 30:14.600
with my sword by myself.

30:17.120 --> 30:18.000
But…

30:20.960 --> 30:21.800
Senior,

30:22.840 --> 30:26.160
I don't want to kill your passion.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.560
It's just that…

30:27.640 --> 30:29.440
About the statement
of "with your sword by yourself",

30:29.520 --> 30:31.120
you are here,

30:31.200 --> 30:33.680
but your sword is missing.

30:41.000 --> 30:42.480
Senior, run!

30:51.360 --> 30:53.320
That sword was not handy.

30:53.400 --> 30:56.240
I always wanted to replace it.
It has been a while.

31:04.320 --> 31:05.400
Come with me.

31:09.960 --> 31:12.080
This is the Sword of Vitality
left by my mother.

31:12.160 --> 31:13.920
This will be my sword.

31:14.840 --> 31:16.560
If I see that demonic cultivator again,

31:16.640 --> 31:18.400
I will slay her with this sword.

31:19.360 --> 31:21.280
CELESTIAL INN

31:21.360 --> 31:22.400
You chose

31:22.480 --> 31:25.080
not to visit the Mirage Palace first

31:25.160 --> 31:27.360
because of Su Ningzhen, right?

31:27.440 --> 31:28.880
All the high-ranking members
of the five sects of the Immortal Alliance

31:28.960 --> 31:30.840
can be the mole.

31:31.440 --> 31:34.440
I can't rule out the possibility that
Su Ningzhen carried out an inside job.

31:35.160 --> 31:36.360
I need to be sure.

31:39.400 --> 31:41.000
I can't stand the two of you.

31:41.080 --> 31:43.680
You are always trying to predict
the next three steps. Aren't you tired?

31:45.840 --> 31:47.960
Sir, I got the map.

31:59.080 --> 32:00.080
What?

32:02.240 --> 32:05.280
Don't you think that you should leave us?

32:05.360 --> 32:08.600
Even so, I can't help myself to eavesdrop.

32:09.200 --> 32:10.600
And if you can deal with that,

32:11.200 --> 32:13.000
I wouldn't be able to help myself
to follow you.

32:13.520 --> 32:16.760
Nothing changes the result.
Why complicate things?

32:17.480 --> 32:19.600
I just want to help.

32:21.640 --> 32:25.080
The communication between humans
and spirits requires trust.

32:34.760 --> 32:36.000
Mr. Nan,

32:36.600 --> 32:38.560
do you have any relics
that offer insurance?

32:39.400 --> 32:40.440
Yes.

32:42.720 --> 32:43.680
Is it necessary?

32:43.760 --> 32:45.960
Someone needs to be assured.

32:47.120 --> 32:48.120
Makes sense.

32:53.800 --> 32:55.280
Here are two wristbands.

32:55.880 --> 32:56.760
They are bonded.

32:57.360 --> 32:58.880
One manipulates the other.

32:58.960 --> 33:00.880
If Miss Mu wears it

33:00.960 --> 33:02.560
and misbehaves,

33:02.640 --> 33:05.200
Xuechen could wear the other one,
activate it,

33:05.280 --> 33:08.000
and you'll be so painful
that you can't move an inch.

33:09.920 --> 33:11.000
This is exaggerating.

33:14.240 --> 33:15.480
I have no intention to control you.

33:16.240 --> 33:17.440
Why don't you…

33:20.640 --> 33:22.760
It's similar to the Spirit Lock in a way.

33:23.560 --> 33:25.000
Though it's more appealing.

33:26.760 --> 33:29.960
I know you are not like the others.
You won't torture me for no good reason.

33:31.480 --> 33:32.320
Xie Xuechen.

33:32.400 --> 33:34.800
Now my life is in your hands.

33:37.560 --> 33:39.120
Can I see that now?

33:39.840 --> 33:40.680
Sure.

33:41.200 --> 33:42.040
Suit yourself.

33:45.720 --> 33:47.720
The Spirit Clan member who stole
the token was injured, right?

33:47.800 --> 33:48.640
Yes.

33:48.720 --> 33:50.480
I heard that the Spirit Clan member
was not bad.

33:50.560 --> 33:52.000
The injury was caused
by Su Ningzhen herself.

33:52.080 --> 33:53.560
Su Ningzhen.

33:54.400 --> 33:55.600
She focuses on water-type spells.

33:56.200 --> 33:58.800
The damage stacks up like ripples.

33:58.880 --> 34:02.640
If the Spirit Clan cannot find
fire-type medicines quickly,

34:03.320 --> 34:05.200
the injury will get worse.

34:08.239 --> 34:10.520
There are only
a few pharmacies in the city.

34:11.320 --> 34:14.159
That Spirit Clan member can't be so dumb
to walk into the trap.

34:14.800 --> 34:16.440
Madam Su ordered a city lockdown
last night

34:17.040 --> 34:19.120
and sent people
to guard all the pharmacies.

34:19.199 --> 34:20.400
If the Spirit Clan member
approached one of them,

34:20.480 --> 34:21.600
they'd have caught the person.

34:21.679 --> 34:24.440
We don't have any news on that front.

34:25.800 --> 34:27.239
Fire-type medicines.

34:28.199 --> 34:29.440
Pharmacies are not the only places
you can find some.

34:32.840 --> 34:35.520
WARMTH PAVILION

34:35.600 --> 34:37.480
WARMTH PAVILION

34:37.560 --> 34:38.800
Hello, our distinguished guests.

34:38.880 --> 34:40.360
Welcome.

34:42.120 --> 34:44.080
You have beautiful faces.

34:44.159 --> 34:46.719
I can tell that fate favors you.

34:47.960 --> 34:49.480
I don't think I've seen you before.

34:49.560 --> 34:52.199
This must be your first visit
to the Warmth Pavilion.

34:52.880 --> 34:56.880
We are the only hot spring relaxation
in Mirage City.

34:56.960 --> 35:01.480
The water we use
is from pure underground hot springs.

35:01.560 --> 35:02.960
It has features like detoxifying,

35:03.040 --> 35:05.160
skin care, driving off the chill,
and improving health.

35:05.800 --> 35:07.080
We are offering you a discount today.

35:07.160 --> 35:09.800
If you want a couple's set,

35:09.880 --> 35:11.840
one of you will have it for free.

35:11.920 --> 35:15.280
What do you say?
Should I make the arrangement right now?

35:15.800 --> 35:17.600
We are not customers.

35:18.880 --> 35:20.920
-Then?
-We are here for jobs.

35:21.000 --> 35:22.440
Jobs?

35:25.960 --> 35:28.480
So, you are not here for a bath.

35:29.440 --> 35:31.160
I'm sorry.

35:31.240 --> 35:34.560
We don't need
any help around here recently.

35:35.160 --> 35:36.840
If you are not customers,

35:36.920 --> 35:39.960
you should leave,
so that I can get back to business.

35:40.040 --> 35:42.840
Guys, the door is over there.
Excuse me for not seeing you off.

35:47.720 --> 35:48.640
It's…

35:49.280 --> 35:52.240
Do you need help now?

35:53.120 --> 35:57.600
In that case, I do. Very much.

35:58.320 --> 36:02.360
May I ask what kind of job you want?

36:02.880 --> 36:06.320
CLEANING BODY AND MIND

36:09.560 --> 36:11.560
Take care. Do visit us again.

36:14.440 --> 36:16.920
They say that clothes can change a person.

36:17.000 --> 36:20.000
How come you are always so handsome
regardless of what you wear?

36:26.240 --> 36:27.280
Take this.

36:30.880 --> 36:32.680
What kind of expression is that?

36:32.760 --> 36:35.360
You are the back-rubbing worker Xie.

36:35.440 --> 36:37.840
Being so cold to customers
will cost you your wages.

36:47.800 --> 36:49.080
Let's try to fit in.

36:50.520 --> 36:53.560
Places like this
have all kinds of people.

36:54.080 --> 36:56.560
They are here for the relaxation.

36:57.120 --> 36:59.400
They won't be as forgiving to you as I am.

37:00.160 --> 37:01.720
You need to adjust your attitude.

37:01.800 --> 37:04.560
Do you need me to show you
how to make people comfortable?

37:07.720 --> 37:09.360
I think you are doing this on purpose.

37:10.440 --> 37:12.080
I never said that I wasn't.

37:12.160 --> 37:15.200
You are the one who wanted to come here.

37:17.760 --> 37:20.320
You'd better find something.

37:24.760 --> 37:27.160
See you later, Xie.

37:30.440 --> 37:31.360
Nice.

37:31.440 --> 37:33.400
-What do you think? Comfy?
-It has been a while since I had one.

37:33.480 --> 37:34.600
You have chosen quite a nice place.

37:34.680 --> 37:35.520
LADIES

37:37.040 --> 37:38.200
Come on. Lie down.

37:38.280 --> 37:39.120
All right.

37:47.840 --> 37:50.760
He can't get out of here or buy medicines.

37:51.920 --> 37:52.960
His only choice

37:53.560 --> 37:55.520
is to use the hot spring of fire-type

37:55.600 --> 37:57.640
to control the damage caused by Madam Su.

37:58.240 --> 37:59.680
So,

37:59.760 --> 38:01.640
we are likely to find him here.

38:01.720 --> 38:03.600
When Madam Su was fighting
the Spirit Clan member last night,

38:03.680 --> 38:04.800
she hit the back side
of the left shoulder.

38:05.680 --> 38:07.040
It must have left a mark.

38:07.120 --> 38:09.800
According to Madam Su,
it was dark last night.

38:09.880 --> 38:11.640
She didn't see if it was a "he" or "she".

38:13.880 --> 38:15.440
She didn't see.

38:15.960 --> 38:17.920
We'll know after our investigation.

38:23.880 --> 38:25.280
More water.

38:25.360 --> 38:26.840
-Yes.
-Coming.

38:28.520 --> 38:30.960
Hey, you! Come here.

38:35.560 --> 38:36.560
PURPLE CLOUD BANK

38:36.640 --> 38:38.960
Someone here?
I've been waiting for so long. Hurry up!

38:39.480 --> 38:40.480
You?

38:40.560 --> 38:41.840
So small.

38:42.360 --> 38:43.200
Hurry.

38:52.040 --> 38:53.240
Watch what you are doing!

38:54.200 --> 38:55.720
Give me a massage.

39:02.240 --> 39:05.240
You look quite strong,
but you lack strength.

39:05.320 --> 39:06.480
Harder.

39:09.240 --> 39:10.960
That's more like it.

39:18.240 --> 39:19.280
Young fellow.

39:19.880 --> 39:23.400
You shouldn't slack off
when you are working.

39:27.160 --> 39:28.240
Are you trying to kill me?

39:29.240 --> 39:30.280
Again.

39:36.720 --> 39:37.720
Give me a shoulder rub.

39:37.800 --> 39:39.280
Tell me if you feel uncomfortable.

39:42.120 --> 39:43.480
This is good.

39:44.880 --> 39:47.640
Sister, you may look small,

39:47.720 --> 39:50.080
but you have a lot of strength.

39:50.160 --> 39:52.120
I will find you again next time.

39:53.280 --> 39:55.600
Do find me next time.

39:55.680 --> 39:59.120
Don't worry. I will ask for you.

40:13.720 --> 40:15.880
-Miss, do you need…
-No.

40:17.680 --> 40:20.320
Don't you want to try?

40:20.400 --> 40:21.920
I'm quite skillful.

40:22.000 --> 40:23.360
I said no.

40:26.720 --> 40:31.200
If I'm not doing my job,
my boss will cut down my wages.

40:31.800 --> 40:33.960
I won't charge you extra fees for this.

40:34.640 --> 40:35.840
Why not give it a go?

40:39.160 --> 40:40.120
What do you want?

40:40.200 --> 40:42.280
Where did that come from?

40:42.360 --> 40:44.600
I'm just a servant.
What could I possibly want?

40:44.680 --> 40:48.600
It's just that people
don't meet for no reason.

40:49.160 --> 40:50.760
I'm asking this for someone else.

40:52.240 --> 40:53.760
Who hired you?

40:54.280 --> 40:56.800
Where is the thing that you stole?

41:03.760 --> 41:06.520
You got rough quickly.
Don't you want to talk?

41:07.120 --> 41:10.880
If you can give me the token,
I will keep your whereabouts a secret,

41:11.760 --> 41:13.680
since you are from the Spirit Clan.

41:21.360 --> 41:22.320
-Serpent Spirit!
-Serpent!

41:22.400 --> 41:23.480
ROOM OF SHALLOW STREAMS

41:25.000 --> 41:25.800
GENTLEMEN

41:25.880 --> 41:27.200
It's a nice place,

41:27.280 --> 41:28.440
-right?
-Not bad.

41:30.360 --> 41:31.960
-What's wrong with you?
-Can't you see?

41:32.040 --> 41:34.120
-Snake!
-There's a snake!

41:36.200 --> 41:37.600
LADIES

41:59.760 --> 42:01.600
So, you don't have the token.

42:02.200 --> 42:03.920
To come to a place like this,

42:04.000 --> 42:06.040
you must have hidden the token
somewhere else.

42:09.800 --> 42:10.720
Snake!
